  "scope": "Pure uncalled Profile3/base4 current-state closure over immutable bytes: raw layout, Root3/Job3 census, Row actor graphs, issuer/row/payload/INIT shape, descriptor bank, borrowed XOI1 root. Any System allocation state fails closed with AllocationUnwired. No INIT/WAL history, source selection, replay or Profile2 behaviour change.",
